  "Turn your recorded episodes into a policy the robot can run. ACT is fast and a great first choice; SmolVLA is a larger vision-language model. You can train on your own GPU, or rent one in the cloud with a Hugging Face login.": "把錄好的片段訓練成手臂能執行的策略模型。ACT 速度快，很適合第一次用；SmolVLA 是比較大的視覺語言模型。可以用自己的 GPU 訓練，或登入 Hugging Face 租用雲端 GPU。",
